((date 2026-11-13) (slug price-band-tiebreak)
 (hypothesis
  "Price-band tiebreak (#3587, pre-registered in dev/experiments/price-band-tiebreak-2026-11-13/README.md at 1034b458e, #3588): among equal cascade scores, order the cheaper raw-price band first (edges [8;14;33]), then the seeded draw. Liveness: P's pooled share of entries (trades.csv + open_positions.csv) at entry_price <= $14 >= 1.3 x S's; if live, ESCALATE at median delta ln(1+R) >= +0.20, >= 4/5 seeds positive and median max DD worse by <= 3 pp. S = record config (= rk-kK spec), P = S + candidate_ranking Price_band_seeded, K = 0..4 paired, top-3000 PIT v12 yearly schedule (deduped lists), 2000-01-01 -> 2026-06-26, path salt 0.")
 (base_scenario
  "price-band-tiebreak-2026-11-13: 10 cells (S/P x k0-k4) at HEAD 1034b458e, image sha256:3865e48e8a61, warehouse v12wk-9236 + corpact-2026-10-27, Claude cloud; validator_diff -check V6 P-kK vs S-kK exit 0 all five; liveness S 329/2842 = 11.58 %, P 389/2756 = 14.11 % -> 1.219 x < 1.3 -> NOT LIVE, no return read; pb-S-k0 byte-identical to chain-w cw-W0-s0 (#3587 inert when off)")
 (window_id top3000-pitv12dedup-1999-2025-26y-kseed5)
